{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/components/fine-grained-reactivity","title":"Fine-grained reactivity","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"fine-grained-reactivity","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Fine-grained reactivity"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Craft templates are reactive at the "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"binding"}]},{"t":"text","text":" level. When a signal changes,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Craft updates the text node, DOM property, class, style, or host binding that"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"read it. It does not need to execute the surrounding component template again."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"// `counterSheet` is the component's sheet, from counter.style.ts.","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"({ ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"counter"},{"text":" }) ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"div","kind":"function"},{"text":"([","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"h2","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Counter'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"p","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ class: counterSheet.value }, counter),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"button","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ click: counter.increment }, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'+'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ]);","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Here, "},{"t":"code","text":"counter"},{"t":"text","text":" is passed to "},{"t":"code","text":"p"},{"t":"text","text":" as a yieldable reader. The renderer drives the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"read for that text binding. Incrementing the counter evaluates that binding and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"patches its text node; the "},{"t":"code","text":"div"},{"t":"text","text":", heading, button, and component template remain"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"untouched."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-binding-is-the-reactive-boundary","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The binding is the reactive boundary"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A function in a rendered position declares a binding. The callback only reads"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"values already derived by the primitive layer; comparisons, formatting, and UI"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"decisions stay out of the template:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"p","kind":"function"},{"text":"(items.totalLabel);","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"button","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    disabled: items.isEmpty,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    title: items.clearTitle,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"'Clear'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"div","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  class: items.emptyClass,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  style: items.emptyStyle,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"totalLabel"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"isEmpty"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"clearTitle"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"emptyClass"},{"t":"text","text":", and "},{"t":"code","text":"emptyStyle"},{"t":"text","text":" are named"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"derived values exposed by the state, query, insertion, or component context."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Pass the reader. If only an item-related dependency changes, Craft evaluates"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"only the affected bindings. A sibling binding depending on another reader does"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"not run."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Static values do not need callbacks:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"h2","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Shopping cart'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"button","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ type: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'button'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" }, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Clear'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"do-not-read-reactive-values-while-building-the-template","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Do not read reactive values while building the template"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A direct read happens while the component constructs its VNodes. It cannot be"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"assigned to one precise DOM binding and becomes a structural template"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"dependency instead:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"// Avoid: these reads happen in the component template.","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"p","kind":"function"},{"text":"(items.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"totalLabel","kind":"function"},{"text":"());","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"button","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ disabled: items.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"isEmpty","kind":"function"},{"text":"() }, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Clear'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"div","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ class: items.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"emptyClass","kind":"function"},{"text":"() });","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Move each read into the binding that consumes it:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"p","kind":"function"},{"text":"(items.totalLabel);","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"button","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ disabled: items.isEmpty }, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Clear'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"div","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ class: items.emptyClass });","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"This is also the rule for component inputs. Pass a yieldable reader directly"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"when the child must observe a changing value. When the child needs fields of"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"an object, explicitly adapt the input with "},{"t":"code","text":"deepYieldable"},{"t":"text","text":":"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"UserCard","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ user: selectedUser });","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The reader is lazy: constructing the parent template does not read"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"selectedUser"},{"t":"text","text":". Craft installs it as the source of the child's "},{"t":"code","text":"user"},{"t":"text","text":" input."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"The child then decides which granular binding observes it:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"UserCard"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftComponent","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"user"},{"text":":","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"Input","kind":"type"},{"text":"<","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"User","kind":"type"},{"text":">) ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ({ user: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"deepYieldable","kind":"function"},{"text":"(user) }),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ({ ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"user"},{"text":" }) ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"h2","kind":"function"},{"text":"(user.displayName),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"When the "},{"t":"code","text":"h2"},{"t":"text","text":" binding first evaluates, "},{"t":"code","text":"yield* user()"},{"t":"text","text":" invokes the reader,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"which reads "},{"t":"code","text":"selectedUser"},{"t":"text","text":". That text binding becomes the signal consumer."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"When the selected user changes, only the binding evaluates again and patches"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the existing "},{"t":"code","text":"h2"},{"t":"text","text":"; neither the parent template nor the child component template"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"runs again."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Reading the input eagerly in the child would move the dependency back to the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"component boundary and is rejected by "},{"t":"code","text":"require-reactive-template-bindings"},{"t":"text","text":":"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"// Avoid: resolving the input while the child template is built.","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[