alse"},{"t":"text","text":" restores synchronous"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"rendering, regardless of the selected strategy. The first delivery supports"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"sync"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"frame"},{"t":"text","text":"; "},{"t":"code","text":"idle"},{"t":"text","text":" is reserved for a later scheduler implementation."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Scheduling improves perceived responsiveness, but it does not reduce the total"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"work needed to create or update the list. For very large or continuously"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"scrolling collections, virtualisation is still preferable because it reduces"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the number of DOM nodes and bindings that exist at once."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"keep-bindings-pure-and-free-of-logic","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Keep bindings pure and free of logic"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A binding reads a value already derived by the primitive layer. It does not"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"format data, make business decisions, or write state:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"// Correct: the primitive exposes the render-ready reader.","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"p","kind":"function"},{"text":"(cart.formattedTotal);","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// Incorrect: rendering changes application state.","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"p","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" counter.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"update","kind":"function"},{"text":"((","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"value"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"