"The current template trace reports component and structural renders, not each"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"individual text or property effect. The absence of a component update therefore"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"confirms that the change stayed below the component boundary; a DOM assertion"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"confirms that the expected binding was patched."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Effects are owned by their rendered nodes. Removing a branch, list item, or"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"component destroys its binding effects, so their dependencies are released with"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the DOM they served."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"migration-checklist","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Migration checklist"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":true,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Move comparisons, formatting, and display decisions into named derived"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"primitive values such as "},{"t":"code","text":"items.isEmpty"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Pass yieldable readers to text bindings ("},{"t":"code","text":"p(counter)"},{"t":"text","text":"), or use a generator"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"when the binding must format: "},{"t":"code","text":"p(function* () { return \\"},{"t":"text","text":"Count: ${yield* counter()}`; })`."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Pass yieldable readers to DOM properties such as "},{"t":"code","text":"value"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"disabled"},{"t":"text","text":", and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"title"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Return complete reactive class and style readers from the primitive."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Pass changing component inputs as yieldable readers."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Express structural changes with "},{"t":"code","text":"ifNode"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"forNode"},{"t":"text","text":","},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"matchNode.exhaustive"},{"t":"text","text":", or "},{"t":"code","text":"deferNode"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Enable the two ESLint rules and remove every direct reactive template read."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Continue with "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/components/","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Components"}]},{"t":"text","text":" for the complete"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"craftComponent"},{"t":"text","text":" model or "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/advanced/observability","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Observability"}]},{"t":"text","text":" to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"inspect rendering and correlated interactions."}]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"the-binding-is-the-reactive-boundary","text":"The binding is the reactive boundary"},{"level":2,"id":"do-not-read-reactive-values-while-building-the-template","text":"Do not read reactive values while building the template"},{"level":2,"id":"structure-has-its-own-reactive-scopes","text":"Structure has its own reactive scopes"},{"level":3,"id":"progressive-fornode-rendering","text":"Progressive forNode rendering"},{"level":2,"id":"keep-bindings-pure-and-free-of-logic","text":"Keep bindings pure and free of logic"},{"level":2,"id":"enforce-the-model-with-eslint","text":"Enforce the model with ESLint"},{"level":2,"id":"what-you-should-observe","text":"What you should observe"},{"level":2,"id":"migration-checklist","text":"Migration checklist"}]}